---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SupportPage from '@components/sections/misc/SupportPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '@data/constants';

const pageTitle = `Industry Applications | ${SITE.title}`;
const metaDescription =
  'Where FerruleX stainless steel fittings are used: instrumentation panels, petrochemical skids, food & hygienic lines, marine utilities and OEM equipment.';
---

<MainLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  customDescription={metaDescription}
  customOgTitle={pageTitle}
  structuredData={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'CollectionPage',
    '@id': `${SITE.url}/applications/`,
    url: `${SITE.url}/applications/`,
    name: pageTitle,
    description: metaDescription,
    inLanguage: 'en-US',
    isPartOf: { '@type': 'WebSite', url: SITE.url, name: SITE.title },
  }}
>
  <SupportPage
    title="Where the parts are used"
    lead="Same catalog, different duty. Name the media and the environment on the RFQ so we do not quote a utility fitting into a chloride line."
  >
    <h2>Analyzer and instrument panels</h2>
    <p>
      Sample and purge lines use <a href="/products/compression-fittings/">double-ferrule fittings</a>,
      <a href="/products/needle-valves/">needle valves</a> and BA or coil tube. Write tube OD, grade and thread. A missing OD is the usual reason a quote stalls.
    </p>

    <h2>Process skids</h2>
    <p>
      Shutoff is a <a href="/products/ball-valves/">ball valve</a>. One-way flow is a
      <a href="/products/check-valves/">check valve</a>. Movement between skids is
      <a href="/products/corrugated-hose/">corrugated hose</a>. Put the design pressure on the RFQ. We will not invent a class to fill the form.
    </p>

    <h2>Food and clean utilities</h2>
    <p>
      Say “hygienic” or “chloride wash” if that is the duty. Tri-clamp hose ends and SS316 are the usual ask. We will not substitute a general cast fitting unless you accept it in writing.
    </p>

    <h2>Marine and packaged equipment</h2>
    <p>
      Salt air usually means SS316. Imported skids often mix NPT and G on the same manifold. If the drawing leaves the catalog, use
      <a href="/oem/">OEM</a> and attach the file.
    </p>
  </SupportPage>
</MainLayout>
